{
    "title": "DJI Fly: Skylink for DJI Drone",
    "description": "Unlock the skies with DJI Fly Skylink and take your drone experience to new heights!\r\n\r\n<b>Compatibility:</b>\r\nDJI Fly Skylink supports a wide range of DJI drones:\r\n\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic Air\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic Air 2\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic Mini\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Enterprise Advanced\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Enterprise Dual\t\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Enterprise\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Pro\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Zoom\r\n\u2022 DJI Mavic Pro\r\n\u2022 DJI Spark\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 4\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 Advanced\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 Professional\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 Professional V2\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 RTK\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 Professional\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 4K\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 Advanced\r\n\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 Standard\r\n\u2022 DJI Inspire 1\r\n\u2022 DJI Inspire 2\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 100\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 300 RTK\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 200 V2\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 210\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 210 V2\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 210 RTK\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 210 RTK V2\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 200\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 600\r\n\u2022 DJI Matrice 600 Pro\r\n\r\nFor *Mavic users, there are some features our app hasn't supported yet: Low Battery Warning, Critical Low Battery Warning, Time to Discharge, Sync Gimbal with Aircraft Heading, Lock Gimbal When Shooting, Gimbal Mode. Play media, Preview media, On/Off Head LEDs & Camera Forward/Down (Mavic Air 2S: double tap is C2, 1-tap is C1)\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer: We want to clarify that this application is not an official DJI Fly app but rather a DJI drone support app using the official DJI Mobile SDK provided by DJI. Still, this app can work perfectly with most DJI drone models, and DJI RCs debut. Additionally, it is not affiliated with or endorsed by any mentioned company, it is not an official product of that company or its affiliates.</b>\r\n\r\nDJI Fly Skylink is the ultimate companion app for your DJI drones, designed to offer unparalleled control, ease of use, and a seamless flying experience. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned drone pilot, \"DJI Fly Skylink\" provides the tools and features you need to explore the skies confidently and creatively.\r\n\r\n<b>Why Choose DJI Fly Skylink?</b>\r\n\r\nIntuitive Interface: Our user-friendly interface ensures easy drone operation, providing clear information for a smooth flying experience, whether you're a beginner or an experienced pilot.\r\n\r\nAdvanced Flight Controls: Take full control of your DJI drones with DJI Fly Skylink's advanced flight features for precision and accuracy in complex maneuvers and effortless aerial shot capture.\r\n\r\nReal-Time Video Transmission: Experience real-time HD video transmission directly to your mobile device. With \"Skylink,\" you can see exactly what your drone sees, allowing you to make quick decisions and adjustments on the fly for the best possible footage.\r\n\r\nSmart Flight Modes: Capture professional-quality videos and photos with intelligent flight modes like ActiveTrack, QuickShot, and Panorama. Ideal for dynamic action scenes or serene landscapes.\r\n\r\nComprehensive Flight Data: Keep track of all your flight details with in-depth flight data logging. DJI Fly Skylink records your drone's flight path, altitude, speed, and more, providing you with valuable insights to improve your flying skills.\r\n\r\nEasy Media Management: Manage your photos and videos directly within the app. Quickly access, edit, and share your stunning aerial footage with friends and family, or upload it to social media platforms to showcase your skills.\r\n\r\nSafe Flying: Safety is our priority. DJI Fly Skylink includes built-in safety features such as obstacle detection, return-to-home functionality, and flight zone restrictions to ensure that your flights are safe and secure.\r\n\r\nFirmware Updates: Stay updated with the latest features and improvements. DJI Fly Skylink allows you to download and install firmware updates directly from the app, ensuring your drone is always up-to-date with the latest technology.\r\n\r\nTake your drone flying experience to new heights with DJI Fly Skylink! Download now and explore the endless possibilities of aerial photography and videography. Whether you're capturing stunning landscapes, action-packed scenes, or unforgettable moments, DJI Fly Skylink is your trusted partner in the sky.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unlock the skies with DJI Fly Skylink and take your drone experience to new heights!<br><br><b>Compatibility:</b><br>DJI Fly Skylink supports a wide range of DJI drones:<br><br>\u2022 DJI Mavic Air<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic Air 2<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic Mini<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Enterprise Advanced<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Enterprise Dual\t<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Enterprise<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Pro<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic 2 Zoom<br>\u2022 DJI Mavic Pro<br>\u2022 DJI Spark<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 4<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 Advanced<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 Professional<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 Professional V2<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 4 RTK<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 Professional<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 4K<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 Advanced<br>\u2022 DJI Phantom 3 Standard<br>\u2022 DJI Inspire 1<br>\u2022 DJI Inspire 2<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 100<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 300 RTK<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 200 V2<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 210<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 210 V2<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 210 RTK<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 210 RTK V2<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 200<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 600<br>\u2022 DJI Matrice 600 Pro<br><br>For *Mavic users, there are some features our app hasn&#39;t supported yet: Low Battery Warning, Critical Low Battery Warning, Time to Discharge, Sync Gimbal with Aircraft Heading, Lock Gimbal When Shooting, Gimbal Mode. Play media, Preview media, On/Off Head LEDs &amp; Camera Forward/Down (Mavic Air 2S: double tap is C2, 1-tap is C1)<br><br><b>Disclaimer: We want to clarify that this application is not an official DJI Fly app but rather a DJI drone support app using the official DJI Mobile SDK provided by DJI. Still, this app can work perfectly with most DJI drone models, and DJI RCs debut. Additionally, it is not affiliated with or endorsed by any mentioned company, it is not an official product of that company or its affiliates.</b><br><br>DJI Fly Skylink is the ultimate companion app for your DJI drones, designed to offer unparalleled control, ease of use, and a seamless flying experience. Whether you&#39;re a beginner or a seasoned drone pilot, &quot;DJI Fly Skylink&quot; provides the tools and features you need to explore the skies confidently and creatively.<br><br><b>Why Choose DJI Fly Skylink?</b><br><br>Intuitive Interface: Our user-friendly interface ensures easy drone operation, providing clear information for a smooth flying experience, whether you&#39;re a beginner or an experienced pilot.<br><br>Advanced Flight Controls: Take full control of your DJI drones with DJI Fly Skylink&#39;s advanced flight features for precision and accuracy in complex maneuvers and effortless aerial shot capture.<br><br>Real-Time Video Transmission: Experience real-time HD video transmission directly to your mobile device. With &quot;Skylink,&quot; you can see exactly what your drone sees, allowing you to make quick decisions and adjustments on the fly for the best possible footage.<br><br>Smart Flight Modes: Capture professional-quality videos and photos with intelligent flight modes like ActiveTrack, QuickShot, and Panorama. Ideal for dynamic action scenes or serene landscapes.<br><br>Comprehensive Flight Data: Keep track of all your flight details with in-depth flight data logging. DJI Fly Skylink records your drone&#39;s flight path, altitude, speed, and more, providing you with valuable insights to improve your flying skills.<br><br>Easy Media Management: Manage your photos and videos directly within the app. Quickly access, edit, and share your stunning aerial footage with friends and family, or upload it to social media platforms to showcase your skills.<br><br>Safe Flying: Safety is our priority. DJI Fly Skylink includes built-in safety features such as obstacle detection, return-to-home functionality, and flight zone restrictions to ensure that your flights are safe and secure.<br><br>Firmware Updates: Stay updated with the latest features and improvements. DJI Fly Skylink allows you to download and install firmware updates directly from the app, ensuring your drone is always up-to-date with the latest technology.<br><br>Take your drone flying experience to new heights with DJI Fly Skylink! Download now and explore the endless possibilities of aerial photography and videography. Whether you&#39;re capturing stunning landscapes, action-packed scenes, or unforgettable moments, DJI Fly Skylink is your trusted partner in the sky.",
